    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>You entreat Tor to unleash his fury, and a bolt of lightning streaks towards your target dealing 1d10 Damage, ignoring Toughness Bonus and Armor Points. Once the target is struck, the lightning arcs to a number of targets up to your Willpower Bonus within 2 yards of the initial target. For every +2 SL, you may increase the distance of the lightning arc by 2 yards from the initial target, increase the number of targets the lightning arcs to by +Willpower Bonus, or cause an extra +2 Damage to any Undead or servants of the Ruinous Powers affected.</p>"
